    {
      "additions": 5,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/90cf5c614eb57e0b6b59fae817a306e3b3c973d8/docs%2Fdeployment%2Fintegrations%2Fairunway.md",
      "changes": 5,
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/contents/docs%2Fdeployment%2Fintegrations%2Fairunway.md?ref=90cf5c614eb57e0b6b59fae817a306e3b3c973d8",
      "deletions": 0,
      "filename": "docs/deployment/integrations/airunway.md",
      "patch": "@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@\n+# AI Runway\n+\n+[AI Runway](https://github.com/kaito-project/airunway) is a Kubernetes-native platform for deploying and managing LLM inference across multiple providers behind a single `ModelDeployment` API. It can serve models with vLLM directly — running the OpenAI-compatible `vllm serve` server as native Kubernetes `Deployment` and `Service` resources — or through vLLM-backed providers such as NVIDIA Dynamo, llm-d, KAITO, and KubeRay, all selected automatically from provider capabilities.\n+\n+For deploying vLLM directly, see the [Direct vLLM provider guide](https://kaito-project.github.io/airunway/providers/vllm). For an overview and installation, see the [AI Runway documentation](https://kaito-project.github.io/airunway/).",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/raw/90cf5c614eb57e0b6b59fae817a306e3b3c973d8/docs%2Fdeployment%2Fintegrations%2Fairunway.md",
      "sha": "68cc838e7730809bee2c414d2a195048a5f5f695",
      "status": "added"
    },
    {
      "additions": 1,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/90cf5c614eb57e0b6b59fae817a306e3b3c973d8/docs%2Fdeployment%2Fk8s.md",
      "changes": 1,
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/contents/docs%2Fdeployment%2Fk8s.md?ref=90cf5c614eb57e0b6b59fae817a306e3b3c973d8",
      "deletions": 0,
      "filename": "docs/deployment/k8s.md",
      "patch": "@@ -19,6 +19,7 @@ Alternatively, you can deploy vLLM to Kubernetes using any of the following:\n - [KServe](integrations/kserve.md)\n - [Kthena](integrations/kthena.md)\n - [KubeRay](integrations/kuberay.md)\n+- [kaito-project/airunway](integrations/airunway.md)\n - [kubernetes-sigs/lws](frameworks/lws.md)\n - [meta-llama/llama-stack](integrations/llamastack.md)\n - [substratusai/kubeai](integrations/kubeai.md)",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/raw/90cf5c614eb57e0b6b59fae817a306e3b3c973d8/docs%2Fdeployment%2Fk8s.md",
